ng=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/48/1856_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ronway:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Did she want him to leave his wife to marry her instead, when he declined is when she decided to murder him?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Wow! I think that is everything. Good job, everyone!</p>",
